      "id": "claim_522bfa11d51f4b3d821a9735346a6e89",
      "statement": "Pushing a tag matching `v*` runs the publish workflow on macOS, Ubuntu, and Windows; every matrix job installs dependencies, runs frontend and Rust quality gates, and invokes the Tauri action to create a draft versioned GitHub release with generated notes and signed updater material.",
